{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-xr-replacement-pod","title":"Vaporesso LUXE XR Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso LUXE XR Pods \u003cem\u003e(2-Pack)\u003c\/em\u003e, featuring a 5mL capacity, GTX Coil Compatibility, and filled from the bottom behind a silicone stopper.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxw XR Pod Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe XR Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso LUXE X Pods (Integrated Coil)\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Vaporesso LUXE XR Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Bottom Fill - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: GTX Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe empty Luxe XR pods can be used with Vaporesso GTX coils. You can pair the DTL pod with either the 0.2 Ohm or 0.3 Ohm coil, while the RDTL pod can be used with the 0.4 Ohm or 0.6 Ohm GTX coils. For a more restricted inhale, select the MTL pod and insert a 0.8 Ohm or 1.2 Ohm coil. The DTL pod works best with e-liquid which is at least 70% VG, while the RDTL and MTL versions work best with 50% VG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne pack contains 2 replacement pods. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41861455675447,"sku":"V Luxe XR Replace Pods","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_xr_replacement_pods_packaging_contents_inside.png?v=1757065525","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-replacement-pod","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




